\newlabel{fig:bn_drift}{{1}{5}{Distribution of Batch Normalization statistics drift (measured via $D_{\text {KL}}$). $M_{11}$ suffers from representational collapse as the feedback loop forces the encoder to memorize recurrent background hallucinations. $M_{12}$ (Detached Soft-OR) breaks this cycle, resulting in separated background/foreground features}{figure.1}{}}
